# Where the contact form sends enquiries.
#
# The form POSTs JSON to this URL:
#   { name, email, phone, company, service, message, submittedAt }
#
# Any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST works — a form service (Formspree,
# Basin), an automation (Zapier, Make, n8n), or your own handler. A 2xx means
# delivered; anything else shows the visitor an error and is logged server-side.
#
# LEAVE THIS UNSET AND THE FORM DOES NOT PRETEND TO WORK: it tells the visitor
# it isn't connected and points them at the phone number and email instead.
# Nothing is silently swallowed.
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
